<main id="main-content">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="hero pb-8">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <h1 class="hero__title">The association</h1>
        <p class="hero__subtitle">
          The Association pour la Modernisation du Clavier Français is a French non-profit association under the
          <em>loi 1901</em>, entirely volunteer-run. It is the organisation behind AZERTY Global and everything the
          project publishes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Purpose -->
    <section class="section pt-0">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__header">
          <h2 class="section__title text-center">Our purpose</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="text-sm text-secondary mb-4">Article 2 of the statutes, signed on 17 March 2026.</p>
          <p class="text-lg text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            The purpose of the association is to contribute to the modernisation of the French keyboard and to make
            written input easier — accented capitals, typography, symbols, accessibility, digital practices — through
            free and open-source keyboard layouts that install on Windows, macOS and Linux.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-secondary leading-relaxed">In particular, it may:</p>
          <ul class="mt-2 text-secondary leading-relaxed pl-6">
            <li class="mb-2">develop, maintain and distribute keyboard layouts suited to contemporary use;</li>
            <li class="mb-2">distribute educational and technical resources;</li>
            <li class="mb-2">run awareness activities, workshops and sessions in schools and companies;</li>
            <li class="mb-2">work with researchers and institutions to evaluate the benefits of these layouts
              scientifically;</li>
            <li>seek grants, donations and partnerships compatible with its purpose.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-secondary">
            Translated from article 2 of the association’s statutes. The French text is the only legally binding
            version.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Activities -->
    <section class="section">
      <div class="container container--narrow">
        <div class="section__header">
          <h2 class="section__title text-center">What the association has done</h2>
          <p class="section__subtitle text-center">Its activities since it was founded, in March 2026.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="d-grid grid-auto-280 gap-4">
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="card__title">Publishing and distributing the layout</h3>
            <p class="card__text">
              The association publishes the AZERTY Global layout for Windows, macOS and Linux, free of charge and
              under the open-source EUPL 1.2 licence. On Windows, a dedicated app is published on the Microsoft Store.
              The <a href="https://github.com/AZERTYGlobal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">source code</a>
              is public and the layout remains a <a href="/en/download">free download</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="card__title">Supporting organisations</h3>
            <p class="card__text">
              An <a href="/en/download">enterprise kit</a> is available for IT departments: an MSIX package signed by
              the association, deployment documents and printable materials. Schools and companies can also write to
              the association directly.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="card__title">Publishing learning resources</h3>
            <p class="card__text">
              The site gathers free resources: a <a href="/en/guide">quick-start guide</a>, a French typography guide,
              a comparison of layouts, a history of AZERTY and a <a href="/en/faq">FAQ</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3 class="card__title">Running the community</h3>
            <p class="card__text">
              User feedback comes in through
              <a href="https://github.com/AZERTYGlobal" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a> and an
              open <a href="https://discord.gg/nYknqshJz3" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Discord
              server</a>. It shapes later versions. Bugs and suggestions go through the
              <a href="/en/feedback">feedback page</a>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="card mt-4">
          <h3 class="card__title">Milestones</h3>
          <ul class="text-secondary leading-relaxed pl-6 mb-0">
            <li class="mb-2"><strong>17 March 2026</strong> — founding general meeting in Clermont-Ferrand; statutes
              signed.</li>
            <li class="mb-2"><strong>27 March 2026</strong> — declaration receipt issued by the Riom sub-prefecture,
              RNA W632015664.</li>
            <li class="mb-2"><strong>7 April 2026</strong> — published in the <em>Journal officiel des
              associations</em>, announcement no. 1771.</li>
            <li class="mb-2"><strong>2026</strong> — the AZERTY Global layout is published free of charge under the
              EUPL 1.2 licence, as a <a href="/en/download">free download</a> and on the Microsoft Store, for Windows,
              macOS and Linux.</li>
            <li><strong>2026</strong> — free educational resources published: a <a href="/en/guide">quick-start
              guide</a>, a <a href="/en/french-typography">French typography guide</a>, a
              <a href="/en/comparison">comparison of layouts</a> and an
              <a href="/en/azerty-history">history of AZERTY</a>.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Host a workshop -->
