        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <p class="text-lg text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            The association runs sessions for companies, schools, public bodies and other nonprofits:
            discovering the layout, French typography awareness (accented capitals, punctuation), and help
            with a deployment.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-secondary leading-relaxed">
            Sessions are volunteer-run, currently in the Auvergne region (France), depending on the team’s
            availability.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4">
            <!--email_off--><a href="mailto:amcf@azerty.global?subject=Workshop%20request" class="btn btn--primary">Request a workshop</a><!--/email_off-->
